{"c":{"278661":["Rein","Male","b278661-t2lZBDDMN44H.jpg","He is a Beast Tamer who originally had no other combat skills except weak fire and healing spells, which leads him to be expelled from the hero's party.",142],"278662":["Kanade","Female","b278662-sCqYMzFOxHvC.png","Kanade is a talented and powerful fighter from the Cat Tribe, the rarest of the strongest races. She left her hometown in search for adventure. After she meets Rein Shroud, she asks him to tame her, and Rein does so, making her his first companion.",378],"278663":["Tania","Female","b278663-XYmcn35gftyj.jpg","Tania is a red dragon, a member of Dragon Tribe, and is traveling the world challenging worthy fighters until Rein and Kanade defeat her. After befriending them, she joins the party, making her his second contractual.",391],"284533":["Sora","Female","b284533-hAHv8Lzamc1O.png","Sora, a dryad from the Spirit Tribe, was given the job of protecting the forest and safeguarding the Shield of Truths. She gave the shield to Rein and others after they told her it was needed to defeat the demon lord. Noticing that she is sad, Rein asks her to tell the reason.",142],"284534":["Luna","Female","b284534-eq81J2FCYtSQ.png","Luna, a Dryad from the Spirit Tribe, was sacrificed to Shadow Knight in order to protect their village. At Sora's request, Rein helped her and her older twin sister by defeating Shadow Knight.",148],"287140":["Nina","Female","b287140-RPIf3iD4xPmf.jpg","Nina, a member of Demigod Race, was worshipped as a deity in her homeland until she is captured and sold into slavery, where she is put magic collar to restrain her and enslaved by Edgar Fromware. After being saved by Rein Shroud, she became his fifth contractual.",128],"287141":["Stella Enplace","Female","b287141-yFouuWuH1tnj.png","She is the vice-captain of the Order of Knights. She created a rebellion group of female knights and formed an alliance with Rein Shroud to stop the misdoings of Edgar Fromware and his father.",35],"290511":["Mina","Female","b290511-a578N9A4wAja.jpg","One of the mages from Rein's former party.",7],"291242":["Tina Hollee","Female","b291242-hlczcD5apphD.jpg","Tina Hollee is a ghost who had been haunting a mansion where she was killed by her previous master until Rein Shroud came and bought the mansion. She later becomes his sixth contractual after Rein helped her in arresting her murderer and now stays at Rein's residence as a maid.",56],"291735":["Leane","Female","b291735-PdsedWPNnSGC.jpg","",10],"291736":["Aggath","Male","b291736-iZHyABfCyhtG.jpg","",3],"291737":["Arios Orlando","Male","b291737-GSx31x7SpZYj.jpg","",2],"291877":["Natalie Flow","Female","b291877-IDOVAXadlqNK.jpg","She is the guild receptionist of the city Horizon.",26],"301457":["Edgar Fromware","Male","b301457-Nto5c6vNvYK1.jpg","",0],"303788":["Child A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303789":["Child B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303790":["Goblin C",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303791":["Goblin B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303792":["Child C",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303793":["Goblin A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303794":["Boukensha A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303795":["Boukensha E",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303796":["Boukensha A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303797":["Boukensha B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303798":["Boukensha B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303799":["Boukensha A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303800":["Boukensha B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303801":["Boukensha C",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303802":["Boukensha C",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303803":["Boukensha D",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303804":["Boukensha D",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303805":["Boukensha E",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303806":["Boukensha F",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303807":["Boukensha G",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303808":["Shounin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303809":["Otokonoko","Male","default.jpg","",0],"303810":["Wakamono",null,"default.jpg","",0],"303811":["Inn Old Lady","Female","default.jpg","",0],"303812":["Hot Dog-ya",null,"default.jpg","",